window.products.push({"id":446164,"name":"Mighty Mug 17920225 Go - The Plastic Travel Mug That Won't Fall Over (0.47 Litre), Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pd6+2tgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Mighty Mug is the first mug that won’t tip over if you accidentally bump into it, but lifts straight up just like any other mug. It is the smartest drinks mug you will ever own. Designed to prevent spillages on your computer, papers or school work, it is also excellent for travelling, caravanning and sailing through choppy seas.  Smartgrip is a new, patented technology that prevents Mighty Mug from falling over when you accidentally knock into it. Simply place on any smooth, flat, solid surface and the suction-style base will grip instantly, preventing you from knocking your drink over by mistake if you hit it. The Smartgrip base only releases its grip if you lift it straight upwards, holding it above the wavy line.  Suitable for hot and cold beverages, Mighty Mug is made with a double wall construction which keeps your drinks hot or cold for longer. The lid snaps open and shut using a simple flip top, to prevent leaks if you are carrying your mug around.  If filling with boiling liquid you must allow it to cool for at least 3 minutes before placing lid on.  Mighty Mug holds 470ml liquid, is 22cm high and 8cm in diameter and available in a variety of colours. It is top rack dishwasher safe, and easy to disassemble for cleaning, but not suitable for use in a microwave or freezer. Made from BPA-Free plastic, which is treated with an eco-friendly additive to reduce the time it takes to biodegrade. While most plastics can take up to 1,000 years to biodegrade this innovative plastic takes approximately 5 years (once you have disposed of it).  Mighty Mug is distributed by Dexam which offers outstanding quality products at excellent value. Since 1957 Dexam has produced and distributed high quality and innovative kitchenware, and we’re proud of it. This is one of the most exciting products we have found recently and we are delighted to add it to our range of products. Set Contains: 1 x Mighty Mug Go in Red colour1 x Care and Use Instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pd6+2tgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mighty Mug","source_asin":"B00CPP8Z1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CPP8Z1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CPP8Z1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
