window.products.push({"id":446228,"name":"Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle,Sports Water Bottle, Double Walled, Leak Proof, 2 Lids(Straw & Spout Lids),BPA Free,Keep Beverages Cold ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sacm3TNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"18/8 Stainless Steel: The water flask is made from 18/8 Stainless steel that is 100% BPA free and non-toxic. The durable materials of the double walled water bottle are also food grade. It will never leave a metal taste or rust. Functional Design: It is a classic powder coating exterior, which is a hand wash only cup. And stainless-steel collar is wide mouth design, which is easy for putting ice cubes. And this non-sweating vacuum insulated flask is rustproof, odor resistant. Reusable 2 Lids and 1 Straw: 1 straw lid, 1 spout lid, 1 straw and 1 straw brush. Both caps can seal airtight with 100% leak-proof. Straw lid is suitable for cycling, hiking, and road trip, Spout lid is perfect for the beach, camping travel and office. Considerate Accessories: The metal vacuum water bottle comes with a specially designed sponge bristle, with a flexible 10” to 13” inch handle which is easy to clean the entire inner surface; and a carry bag with adjustable strap, which is convenient for all your outdoors. 12/24 Hours: Betico vacuum insulated metal thermos flask is made for outdoor lovers, its double walled material keeps your drink Cold for up to 24 hrs, and Hot for up to 12 hrs. (Coffee & other hot liquids stay heated for hours while cold water with ice keeps cool throughout the day.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sacm3TNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Betico","source_asin":"B09LM18Q3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LM18Q3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LM18Q3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
