window.products.push({"id":446367,"name":"Chic Home Wild Cheeta 9 Piece Quilt Set Cheetah Inspired Animal Pattern Print Bed in A Bag - Sheet Set Decorative Pillows Shams Included, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i+2KYPssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your bedroom a fun, lively look with the unique style of the Wild Cheeta quilt set from Chic Home. This exotic quilt features a cheetah inspired animal pattern print on the face and a solid color backing on the reverse. Two design coordinated pillow shams, four embroidered pillowcases, an embroidered flat sheet and a solid white fitted sheet are included to complete the set. Specifications: Size: Queen Color Scheme: Black/Gold/Tan Piece Count: 9 Set Includes: 1pc Cheetah Pattern Quilt (88” x 90”) 2pc Cheetah Pattern Pillow Shams (20” x 26”) 1pc Embroidered Flat Sheet (90” x 102” + 4\") 1pc Fitted Sheet (60” x 80” + 15”) 4pc Embroidered Pillowcases (21” x 31” + 4\") Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, synthetic down alternative filling Fabric and Design: Silky soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material Exotic cheetah inspired animal pattern print Features: Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning down alternative is perfect for those allergic to traditional down Just the right weight to keep you comfortable when the weather gets warmer Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i+2KYPssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B095TG6KN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095TG6KN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095TG6KN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446368,"name":"Under Sink Organizer, 2 Tier Under Bathroom Cabinet Storage, Black Counter Organizer with Hooks, Pull Out Sink Storage Rack, Multi-purpose Under Sink ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zNFAqOPEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Need something easy and accessible to organize your under-sink supplies? Give this under-sink organizer for a try. You can place your items into the two tiers, using the hooks to hang the things like a dish cloth on. Note that the maximum height of the bottle that can be accommodated in the bottom area is 11.4 inches. It works well for anything from the bathroom to the kitchen to laundry room storage. ★Equipped with two rear wheels, it is recommended to lift this product by 15 degrees to make it easier to pull out. Plus, four anti-slip pads keep this under sink storage rack in place, so it won't slip around or cause any scratches to your surfaces. While it may be a little tall for some spaces (Measuring is key here!), it'll get the job done in most. ★Made of upgrade ABS plastic material and thicker stainless steel pipes, it is durable, easy to clean, and can withstand dampness and moisture. And the hollow design will not cause water accumulation. This will ensure your purchase lasts a long time and is very easy to maintain. ★Assembly is required before you can start using this storage organizer to straighten out your pantry, under-sink area, or higher cabinets. But no tools are required and hole punching. You just need the 3 minutes to finish the installation. ★You don't need to have any concerns about the product. Please reach out to our team with any questions, concerns, or comments. We will get back to you within 24 hours. Your satisfaction is ours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zNFAqOPEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bulkniu","source_asin":"B0BKJK8Y3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKJK8Y3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKJK8Y3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446369,"name":"ALL FOR YOU 1-inch Mini Blinds- Black Color (31\"x64\")(Please Read Warning About Children Safety)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dJa9QLNtL._AC_.jpg","description":"This extra wide 1\" mini blinds is made of Lead-free PVC vinyl, easy use and easy installation! It will be just what you want to keep your privacy. Warning: Young children can STRANGLE in cord and bod chain loops. They can also wrap cords around their necks and STRANGLE. Always keep cords and bead chins out of children’s reach. Move cribs, playpens, and other furniture away from cords and bead chains. Children can climb furniture to get to cords. Do not tie cords together. Make sure cords do not twist together and create a loop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dJa9QLNtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALL FOR YOU","source_asin":"B07MKLP8G9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKLP8G9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKLP8G9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
