window.products.push({"id":446409,"name":"Flash Furniture Lana 14 Inch Metal Platform Bed Frame - No Box Spring Needed with Steel Slat Support and Quick Lock Functionality (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-40GM71hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polish the look of your bedroom or guest room with the sophisticated, artisan design of this black textured finish full metal platform bed frame. The lack of a headboard and footboard will streamline a modern bedroom but will also give the illusion of an open, airy space in a small room and making the bed is infinitely easier with no obstacles in the way. If you like to change the layout of your room often, this metal full bed frame is easily moved making redecorating a breeze. Best of all, the 12.5 inches of clearance under the frame allows for generous underbed storage and easy access for cleaning. If you're looking for a solid, stable metal bed frame that can last for years without breaking down you've come to the right place. This platform bed frame is constructed from 19 gauge solid steel reinforced with metal screw construction and holds up to 650 pounds static weight to accommodate most users. Solid steel slats stay in place to prevent sagging helping to increase the lifetime of your mattress. This metal platform bed frame will support your memory foam, latex or traditional innerspring mattress with no need for a box spring. Felt pads between the middle rail and support slats reduce noise for a peaceful nights sleep while adhesive strips prevent your mattress from moving. Fixed plastic floor glides will prevent damage to your flooring. In case of spills or dust build up, simply clean with a damp cloth. Easily assembled, this full size metal platform bed frame will be ready to go in 30 minutes or less with the included tools for quick use. Pair this metal frame with our 12 Inch CertiPur-US Certified Foam and Pocket Spring Mattress to complete your setup and get an excellent nights sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-40GM71hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B09YZQP173","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YZQP173","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YZQP173","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
