window.products.push({"id":446417,"name":"Trendier Semi Sheer Curtains 84 inch Length,Airy Drapes Bedroom Privacy Curtain, Stained Glass ​Meadow Flower Dragonfly Print Window Treatments Curtai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EU-HabffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our voile texture semi sheer curtains are a perfect home decoration,improve the quality of life while also protecting privacy and filtering the light.Draperies are an essential partner in your daily life.👾 Quality window treatments with soft breathable semi sheer voile fabric and fine stitching craftsmanship,let you fondle admiringly.👾 Our unique semi sheer curtains are designed to give your room charm and luminosity,with modern exquisite draperies pattern creative idea,draperies can match almost all types of home styles and deeply impressed your friends or family.👾 Semi sheer drapes can perfectly create a comfortable and airy indoor environment,easily break the dullness of the room.👾 Window curtain panels can play a important role in filtering out the dazzling sunlight,softening the daylight and easily brighting up the room.👾 Window treatments panels can still play a good role in protecting privacy,people can not see anything of the indoor from outside of the windows.Various Size Information of Draperies:➢52x45in*2➢52x54in*2➢52x63in*2➢52x72in*2➢52x84in*2➢52x96in*2➢52x108in*2👾 Suitable for various places,such as kitchen,bedroom,kids room,living room,bathroom,dining room,guest room,sliding door,patio door,nursery,office,cafe etc.👾 Easy to hang drapes and slide smoothly.👾 Easy to clean,not easy to deform,do not shrink/fade/wear,machine washable in cold water,gentle cycle,light iron if needed,do not bleach.👾 Our draperies can make you cheerful enjoy your own space and do whatever you want without worry.👊 If you have any questions,please contact me.I'm waiting for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EU-HabffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trendier","source_asin":"B09H466N72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H466N72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H466N72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446418,"name":"Froth Au Lait Professional Elite S14 Stainless Steel Heat On/off Frother","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+dTrznb4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Froth Au Lait Professional Elite FALnh-S14, with award winning Froth Au Lait technology, is a Commercially Rated, NSF Approved, Automatic Hot Milk Frother. This versatile ALL STAINLESS STEEL PROFESSIONAL model with HEAT OR NO HEAT OPERATION is the ONLY FROTHER which can prepare both HOT OR COLD FROTH as well as WHIPPED CREAM. It includes a selectable heat switch to turn the unit’s heater ON or OFF. Like all Froth Au Lait Hot Milk Frothers, the FALnh-S14 heats and whips milk to prepare the richest and longest lasting froth WITHOUT STEAM. It shuts off automatically when the froth reaches the perfect heated temperature. Finally, with the touch of a button, an effortless and foolproof way to prepare hot milk and the thickest froth ever for specialty hot beverages such as cappuccinos, and lattes. On a cold winter day also prepare delicious, creamy hot chocolate, chai tea, and café au lait. On a hot summer day, turn the heat off and prepare cold flavored froth for iced cappuccinos, lattes, refreshing cold beverages and low calorie fruit & dessert toppings. Prepare fresh gourmet whipped cream for decadent desserts, fruits, and so much more. This Model works alongside your coffee or espresso machine and MAKES EACH CAPPUCCINO OR LATTE A MASTERPIECE. Froth Au Lait features the Flavor Hatch, allowing you to add flavored syrups, powders and liqueurs directly into the milk. The Professional models have 2 interchangeable whips which allows you to vary the amount of froth and hot milk. It’s unique REFRESH FEATURE allows milk to be re-frothed quickly. FINE RESTAURANTS ARE CHOOSING FROTH AU LAIT PROFESSIONAL MODELS OVER THE STEAMERS ON THEIR CAPPUCCINO MACHINES. SAY GOODBYE TO INCONSISTENT, POOR FROTH, STEAM, TRAINING AND MAINTENANCE PROBLEMS. SAY HELLO TO THE THICKEST, LONGEST LASTING, AND EASIEST HOT OR COLD FROTH EVER! THE PROFESSIONAL ELITE “THE BARISTA WITH A PLUG”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+dTrznb4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Froth Au Lait","source_asin":"B00138Y9CI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00138Y9CI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00138Y9CI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
