window.products.push({"id":446620,"name":"Unicook Bamboo Pizza Peel, Premium Pizza Paddle Spatula, Tapered Cutting Board with Handle for Baking Serving Homemade Pizza, Bread in Oven and Grill,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814TT6MxtmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s an old saying: Baking is a science. If so, the kitchen will be your laboratory. You do the experiment, we offer you the necessary tools. Unicook Premium Bamboo Pizza Peel Paddle is specially designed and an essential tool for pizza or baking lover. Why Unicook Pizza Peel is Recommended? 1. No sharp edges like metal peel to hurt you or your family. 2. No wood chips fallen like wood peel to contaminate your baking goods. 3. Durable construction, will not crack or become deformed easily under normal using condition. How to Use: 1. Sprinkle some flour or cornmeal onto the pizza paddle before sliding raw dough; 2. Carefully transfer the pizza, bread or cake to be baked onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel; 3. Once baking finished, slide out the baked goods safely from the hot oven. Tips To Prevent Pizza Dough From Sticking to Your Pizza Peel: 1. Dust the peel with some flour or cornmeal to create non-stick surface. Sprinkle extra flour for damp dough if needed. 2. Stretch the dough on the worktop and then move to the peel for toppings 4. Don’t overload the pizza with toppings; After each topping, do a very quick shake back and forth 5. Work quickly once the dough hits the peel, so the flour doesn’t absorb water from the dough 6. Make sure your dough is at room temperature for less moisture. Care Instructions: 1. Hand wash the pizza peel in warm soapy water; Do not soak the peel in water. 2. Use a soft sponge or cloth to scrap off any excess crumbs, avoid using abrasive scrubbers 3. Prop it up and air dry after cleaning. 4. Re-season your peel every 3 months with food grade mineral oil (make sure the peel is completely dry before seasoning).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814TT6MxtmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unicook","source_asin":"B088WK7SJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088WK7SJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088WK7SJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
