window.products.push({"id":446624,"name":"Induna Arts South Africa African Shona Art Abstract Family of Three Stone Sculpture- Simple - ~8.3\" Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RZ4WCPhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The word Zimbabwe means house of stone based on the Great Zimbabwean ruins. The Shona have been stone carvers for centuries and are some the best stone carvers on the African continent. The sculpture signifies the importance of the family in African culture. The stone used for the carving is fetched from quarries which are sometimes up to 100 miles away from the village where the artist works. Each stone is different and contains a variety of colors, striations and naturally occurring lines. The sculptures are fragile. Kindly note that the dimensions may vary up to 1/2 an inch due to final finishing. - Shona sculpture is a unique form of art that stems from centuries of African tradition and cultural beliefs. Each piece is carefully crafted by artisans and have traveled from Africa across the world to bring a unique flair to any home or office. - Skillfully hand sculpted from Zimbabwean soapstone. - Great home decorative accent with an African flair. - Good home accent piece or gift for families. - The handcrafted nature of these items will create variations in color, size and design. No two items are exactly the same. Items are grouped according to size, weight, color, and style. The photos shown are an accurate representation of the carving you will receive. Slight scuffs or feint hairline scratches are inherent to this product. Product Dimensions: Height 8.3\" Width: 4.7\" Depth/Length: 3.1\" Approximate weight without packaging: 2.5 lbs. Note: The photo shown of the item is an accurate representation of the sculpture being sold. Slight variations in color and size might occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RZ4WCPhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Induna Arts South Africa","source_asin":"B01L7M9PQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L7M9PQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L7M9PQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
