window.products.push({"id":446680,"name":"OFLILAK Wooden Digital Alarm Clock, 4 Level Adjustable Brightness and Voice Control, Display Time Temperature Date for Bedroom Office Home(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LGp7SRsrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Two display modes: Press button “set’ for 1 second to transform ”dp-1” to “dp-2” or ”dp-2” to ”dp-1”. And ”dp-1” means LED screen automatically conversion time, date, temperature and ”dp-2” means LED screen display time all the time.Very flexible. ❤Sound control function：Press button “DOWN” for 1 second to transform ”on:Sd” to “- -:Sd” or ”- -:Sd” to ”on:Sd”, and “on:Sd” means after 30s no any press, LED display automatically closed, and ”- -:Sd “means LED screen display all the time.This is useful for power saving and sleeping well. ❤Adjustable brightness and 12/24 hour format：Press button “UP” for 3 seconds and it display “L1”, then adjust the luminance by button “DOWN” to darken and “UP” to brighten.There are three display luminance adjustments and darken from L1 to L3. Press button “UP” for 1 seconds to transform ”℃” to “℉” or ”℉” to ”℃”. ❤3 ALARMS: After setting time and date by pressing button “SET” for 3 seconds, you can continue to set alarm clock. There are 3 separate wake-up time to remind you the important dates or appointments. ❤Dual power supply：This desk alarm clock come with USB power cable or it can be powered by 3*AAA batteries(Not Included) using as a wireless alarm clock so it won’t be dead to tell you the time. And it can be used at bedroom or carry it to other place like library, classroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LGp7SRsrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFLILAK","source_asin":"B07RXYTPJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RXYTPJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RXYTPJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
