window.products.push({"id":446722,"name":"Bringsine Washable Cotton Linen Solid Design Tablecloth,Rectangle Table Cloth Cover for Kitchen Dinning Tabletop Buffet Decoration(Rectangle/Oblong, 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ud9k10pGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Bringsine Washable tablecloth Fabric Dust-Proof Table Cover for Kitchen Dinner Picnic Table Cloth Home Decoration Cover any table with stylish sophistication. Bring practical elegance to all your common surfaces with the cotton Tablecloth by Bringsine.  Multi-size cloth provides ample coverage for your different size tables, buffet tables, dining room tables, and beyond. Featuring a variety of brilliant patterns across the special design, our line of premium tablecloths offers chic, affordable flair for every holiday party or dinner. Enjoy hassle free cleanup with strong, durable and stain resistant cotton fabric material. For all your birthday, holiday, wedding, and Sunday dinner get-togethers, depend on Bringsine for stunning design and fabulous functionality. Ideal Multi Shape and Size Accommodate the majority of buffet and dining room tables with a perfectly oblong/ Square/ Round cover. Whether indoors or outdoors, dress up your folding tables for a dash of decorative elegance. Strong material repels dust. It's also classier than vinyl. Elegant Design brings a crisp, chic look to your wedding buffet, Thanksgiving dinner table, or backyard affair. Size Note: For Dining Table:Tablecloth Length =Table Length + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm), Tablecloth Width = Table Width + 16\"~24\"(40 ~ 60 cm), each end drops approximately 8\" ~ 12\" (20 ~30 cm) For Tea Table: Tablecloth Length = Table Length + 8\"~16\"(20~40 cm), Tablecloth Width = Table Width + 8\"~16\"(20~40 cm), each end drops approximately 4\"~8\"(10~20 cm) Please allow 1-2 cm error due to manual measurement and the picture may not reflect the actual color as different monitor display and light effect. Affordable & Hard Wearing Don't waste money on junky disposable tablecloths.Only buy from Bringsine to get quality products and warranty customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ud9k10pGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bringsine","source_asin":"B07TC2S4T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TC2S4T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TC2S4T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446723,"name":"Presto 05464 Dual Basket ProFry Immersion Element Deep Fryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WHNNCQTGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Get a great professional-style fryer that's compact enough to use at home with this Presto stainless steel deep fryer. The 1800-watt immersion element provides fast preheating and temperature recovery for multiple batches. But the hefty 12-cup capacity allows for big family-sized meals each time. Dual baskets let you prepare different foods simultaneously. Mess is minimized by a splatter-protecting lid and spray-clean grease filter. The removable enameled oil pot, frying baskets, and base are dishwasher safe. Made of enameled stainless steel and hard-anodized aluminum. Imported. 10-1/2Hx15Wx15L\". Amazon.com Fried food is comfort food--think French fries, doughnuts, or shrimp tempura--and almost everyone craves it at some time or another. But it can be kind of messy to make at home. The Presto Dual Basket ProFry electric deep fryer is an easy-to-use, self-contained frying unit, so there's precious little mess. The lid has three sets of slots to accommodate the prongs of the fry basket--two for side-by-side frying and a central set for a one-basket batchand it can stay on during the frying process to prevent spattering. A grease filter cuts down on the fine spray of oil that can occur with an open-top fryer. The Dual Basket ProFry fits easily on most kitchen countertops, and its neutral, no-nonsense look--gray matte aluminum with black accents--would not be out of place in a working professional kitchen or on a cooking show. The removable enameled oil pot holds up to twelve cups of oil or six pounds of shortening, and can handle family-size batches of food. The large oblong baskets also accommodate large pieces of meat or fish. A thermostat dial knob allows the oil to be heated up to the optimum frying temperature of 375 degrees F; the immersion element helps recover oil temperature between batches. An indicator light to the left of the thermostat dial goes off when the oil has reached the desired temperature, usually taking about 10 minutes. The frying baskets each have two small hooks on the back that hang over the lip of the unit so that baskets and food can rest at a good angle for efficient draining. The power cord has a magnetic safety connection--if the unit is jostled during cooking, the cord will disconnect, shutting power off immediately. And there's an automatic shut-off function for overheating situations; a reset button in the back will reactivate the unit. After frying, unplug the unit and allow it to cool completely before attempting to empty oil. (For more stability, lift the oil pot from opposite corners when removing to empty oil.) Wash the removable pot, fryer lid and frying basket (with removable handle) in warm water with mild detergent and a nonabrasive sponge or cloth, or in the dishwasher. The control assembly lifts out for cleaning. It is not immersible; wipe with a damp cloth to clean. The grease filter does not need to be replaced; it can be cleaned with a dish brush under warm running water. The Presto Dual Basket ProFry measures 14 by 14 by 11 inches (basket handles extend an additional 4 inches). Presto guarantees this product with a one-year limited warranty. A detailed instruction and recipe pamphlet is enclosed. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WHNNCQTGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Presto","source_asin":"B0000Z6JKA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000Z6JKA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000Z6JKA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
