window.products.push({"id":446732,"name":"Melange 5- Pieces Place Setting Wave Premium Porcelain Dinnerware Set | Service for 1 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v-g8v5hSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Melange is about the essence of meals. It is designed to coordinate with your existing heirloom pottery as well as mix and match with formal and casual stemware and flatware. The premium porcelain material makes it suitable to serve your meals from the microwave; the large mugs are designed to welcome you in the mornings; the sophisticated yet functional design of the fine china place setting lets you shine during sushi for two or other special meals. The chip resistant plates will perform at your fiesta parties every time and wash white and clean in your dishwasher. It is vitrified to withstand everyday basic catering and can also be used as a commercial hotel collection or at the grand buffet of a wedding. Wave is a modern white tableware building a common triangle among conversations, music and meals like modern art. The dishware combines geometric forms of circles and squares into modern grace dune lines. Ready for a new Wave idea? The dinnerware is capturing the trend of a contemporary New York metropolitan haute couture life style. Yet the functional and timeless form gives the host freedom for imaginative presentations like a charter club meeting on Nexos or for a book club on the countryside of Boulder Creek. Each piece combines round and square in a subtle wave-like design which mixes and matches well with other conventional dinnerware and modernist dining sets. The great white dinnerware set is made of premium vitrified aluminum porcelain also called new bone china, for its features of being thin like ivory china but still durable like premium dinnerware. Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F, Wave makes it a great commercial product safe for cutting on with knives and keeping the food surface non-absorbent. It has close to 0% water porosity that keeps products strong and break resistant. It is safe for use from freezer to oven or microwave, and dishwasher. It’s a great for a wedding, birthday or Christmas gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v-g8v5hSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B009OYMZ56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009OYMZ56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009OYMZ56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446733,"name":"Pulaski Curio, 34 by 17 by 80-Inch, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t885HLMDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It is hardly surprising that Pulaski is the world's No.1 purveyor of curios especially when you examine this curio. Our curio is designed with generous proportions, unobstructed views and sleek sides that make it easy to bunch several for a complete wall display. A closer look reveals the softly curved fronts both frame and glass and a modern raised plinth base. This curio is solidly built in select hardwood solids and veneers with our sophisticated dark brown Pacific Heights finish. Each curio features a mirrored back, high-low halogen lighting, four adjustable glass shelves and adjustable glides for leveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t885HLMDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pulaski","source_asin":"B0037AXBII","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0037AXBII","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0037AXBII","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
