window.products.push({"id":446737,"name":"Amtoodopin Blacklight Astronaut Tapestry Fantasy Forest Tapestry UV Reactive Galaxy Space Tapestry Glow in the Dark Tapestry Neon Jellyfish Tapestry W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rrA4LHeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazing Material: This black light astronaut tapestry is made of 100% premium polyester fiber which is soft, skin-friendly and smooth. It will be a good choice for your home decor. Original Design: This glow in the dark tapestry looks great. It includes spaceman, mixed color mushroom, jellyfish and galaxy starry sky and so on. Easy to hang. Size Choice: Choose the suitable size for different usages, W59\"×H51\", W78\"×H59\". Extensive Using: This trippy mushroom wall hanging tapestry is perfect for bedroom, teen room, wall hanging, dorm room decor, living room. Hanging it in the room can make people feel relaxed. Also, it’s a good gift for your friends. Wash Care: Gently machine wash, hand wash with cold water, do not bleach and tumble dry on low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rrA4LHeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amtoodopin","source_asin":"B0B5WP1TT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WP1TT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WP1TT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446738,"name":"Vintage Coffee Mugs, Glass Coffee Mugs 14 Oz Set of 4 Embossed Glass Cups, Tea Cups, Glass Coffee Cups for Cappuccino, Latte, Cereal, Yogurt, Hot/Cold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z8sdMniqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose these mugs? A stunning addition to your table, this mug and spoon set stands out in every setting. Perfect for casual and formal occasions, these cups are sure to be seen and make an impression on your guests. Why are they special? The unique, elegant handcrafted design is unlike any other. The embossed glass comes in two different styles, making a pair of each to complete your set and complement one another. The set is completed with two dot pattern cups and two floral pattern cups. This new age take on a glass mug creates the perfect vintage appearance with superior, modern, break- resistant technology and glassware. What can they be used for? When it comes to versatility, these cups are incredible. The cups can be used for various purposes. Use them for your morning coffee, place them in the fridge to make overnight oats, or even as a bowl to serve a parfait in. The four cups are made with premium quality glass. The thick layers of glass are sure to insulate your beverage and keep your treat hot or cold. Perfect and convenient for all year round, these cups will prove their durability. Why is it a great edition to your kitchen? Your cupboard will look elevated with this gorgeous cup set added to your mug collection but it will soon become your favorite due to its versatility and stunning design. These mugs have a 14 ounce capacity perfect for holding your espresso, latte, chai, tea, hot chocolate and every other delicious drink. The translucent glass makes for perfect presentation and aesthetics, making you even more excited to be your own barista. What’s Included in the set? Each mug comes with its matching stainless steel shiny gold spoon. Ideal for stirring sugar, mixing your milk, and measuring your syrup. Instructions Please wash mugs with soapy hot water before your first use. Ideally, continue","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z8sdMniqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BRGZTNG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRGZTNG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRGZTNG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
