window.products.push({"id":446805,"name":"Taiwon Metal Stainless Steel Modern Space pattern flatware, Round Bowl Soup Spoon set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gwP3FLQPL._AC_SL1162_.jpg","description":"Modern Space is very simple and classy pattern of Taiwon Metal Industry. This pattern became one of the most widely used patterns since 2003. Designer got inspiration from space and its mystique. Comes in a set of 4 Soup Spoon - 6.8 Inches long***Material Information***18/10 and 18/0 is not the same quality of material used and vary considerably in price and composition. Stainless flatware that is 18/10 means that the material is consist of 18% chromium and 10% nickel. Similarly, 18/8 is 8% ofickel and 18/0 is 0%. The higher the nickel content, the more protection the flatware has from corrosion. Water and dishwasher detergents tend to be harsh to stainless steel flatware and that can sometimes cause blemishes. These can often be removed with a stainless steel cleanser but pitting, chipping or rusting sometimes cannot be removed. 18/10 and 18/8 are protective for rust, and these usually last much longer than 18/0.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gwP3FLQPL._AC_SL1162_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenWide Corp","source_asin":"B007MH85R4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007MH85R4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007MH85R4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
