window.products.push({"id":446823,"name":"Collapsible Kitchen colander, Food-Grade -Silicone Over-the-Sink Strainers with Extendable Handles, Space-Saver Folding Kitchen Strainer,, 6 Quarts Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S0eSurhxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Kitchen collapsible colander will exceed your expectations and will simplify and change your life. By folding down to less than 2 inches it can fit in places you never thought possible. Use for all your straining needs from fresh fruits, leafy greens to pasta, beans, lentils, potatoes and so much more. ☻Sleek and Rugged with Modern and Vibrant Colors Update your kitchen in a fun way with rugged design that will stand the test of time. The bright colors let you express yourself in your cooking. ☻Large Capacity The Kitchen collapsible colander holds almost 6 quarts of your favorite food. Easily strain multiple cans or a whole box of pasta at the same time. Gone are the days of having to do multiple batches of straining. This one can handle it all. ☻Compact and Practical Design By folding down to under 2 inches you can declutter your kitchen by storing this colander anywhere, even in a drawer. With the feet the colander can stand by itself with no help required. The extendable arms allow it to fit over almost every kitchen sink and the non-slip pads keep it safely in place. ☻Easy to Clean Dishwasher safe for quick cleanup. Thanks to the food safe, durable, and heat resistant materials gone are the days of washing by hand for fear of damaging your old strainer. Go ahead and put it on the bottom shelf, it can handle the heat. Get started now! Product information: Material: rubber + PP Product features: environmentally friendly, non-toxic, non-stick, durable, safe, easy to clean Adapt to the temperature: lowest temperature -40 ℃, highest temperature 230 ℃ Apply: microwave oven, oven, dishwasher, steamer. Can be boiled disinfection Capacity 3.8L Size: total length of 61 * 26 * 12cm, the total length of contraction 39 * 26 * 4.1cm  this item is a lot easier to clean because of the bottom part of he strainer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S0eSurhxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QIANKEXUN","source_asin":"B06XVC4517","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XVC4517","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XVC4517","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
