window.products.push({"id":446844,"name":"WindoDeco Window Film Privacy Rainbow 3D (23.6 in x 6.5 ft) Decorative Holographic Window Sticker with Static Cling No Glue for Home Living Room Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MeX9-M8pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WINDODECO 3D RAINBOW FILM BRINGS JOY IN YOUR HOUSE BY CREATING COLORFUL RAINBOW SPARKLE ON THE WINDOW AND IN THE ROOM KEY FEATURES 1. WindoDeco 3D Rainbow Window Film has no color itself. Rainbow effect is seen when sun shines through the window.  2. 3D Rainbow sticker is designed for smooth, flat, and clean glass surfaces. Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. 3. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and place the smooth side of the film to the glass. Otherwise, it will not stick. 4. If you want to remove the 3D Rainbow window cling, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off easily without leaving any residue. HOW TO INSTALL 3D RAINBOW FILM 1. Clean the target surface thoroughly. Make sure there is no dust or lint on glass. 2. Measure the surface and cut the film. Leave an extra inch margin on each side for an easy adjustment. 3. Prepare diluted soap water solution in any spray bottle. Mix ¼ tsp of mild soap (e.g. Dawn) or no tears baby shampoo (without conditioner) with 1 quart of water. Spray window surface with soap mix. 4. Peel off the transparent backing film and spray the window film with soap mix. 5. Apply the window film on the window or glass surface. 6. Use squeegee to remove excess water and bubbles - from center pushing towards outside. 7. Wipe off excess water using towel. 8. Carefully trim off the margins. FAQ Q1. Do I apply window film on the inside or outside of the house? A1. Window Film is designed for indoor use only. Q2. Window film doesn’t stick. What’s wrong?  A2. You haven’t removed transparent backing film, or you are not applying the smooth side of the window film to the window.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MeX9-M8pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WindoDeco","source_asin":"B08RCWD24R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RCWD24R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RCWD24R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
