window.products.push({"id":446919,"name":"BXQQ 67\"X27.5\" Heated Blanket Portable and Machine Washable Shawl for Women, Cordless USB Battery Operated Electric Blanket for Office Home Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YXtbzWHDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"When you shiver in the cold winter, do you need a heated blanket shawl that can protect you from the cold?When you want to move flexibly at home, or you want to go out to play or join a party, do you want an electric blanket that can be free of wires? You need our cordless heated blanket shawl.Cordless heated usb battery electric blanket wrap shawl,washable heated throw warm knee pads portable heated blanket throw for travel office home outdoor.Instructions:✅How to turn on/off: Insert the USB connector into the mobile power supply, then press and hold the switch on the multifunctional blanket. The switch shows a red light, indicating that the blanket has started to work. Press and hold the switch to turn off the power.✅How to adjust the temperature:After turning on the blanket, the switch shows a red light, indicating it's in the high temperature range is 120°F-131°F, and then press the switch,the light shows white,now the middle temperature range is 113°F-120°F,then press the switch until the light is blue,now is the low temperature range 104F-113°F.✅How to set the timing timeIn any temperature range, tap the switch twice in quick succession, the indicator light will flash quickly, and the timing time is 30 minutes. Tap the switch twice in quick succession again, the indicator light will switch to slow flashing, and the timing time is 60 minutes.Notifiction:✅This product does not include mobile power.✅Please use a power bank with output greater than 5V, 2A.Package included:1 x Heated Blanket Shawl1 x Storage Bag1 x Specification","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YXtbzWHDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BXQQ","source_asin":"B08P8XS2QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P8XS2QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P8XS2QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
