window.products.push({"id":446977,"name":"Premium & Ultra Soft Bamboo Mattress Protector Full - 100% Waterproof Mattress Protector Cover, Breathable, CrinkleFree & Noiseless - Hypoallergenic -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hppI5mtnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Need: Protect your full mattress from spills, stains, and general wear and tear with this premium quality bamboo full mattress protector from COMFETY. This full size waterproof mattress protector is made of soft and comfortable material that provides a protective barrier for your full mattress, ensuring its longevity and pristine condition. Made to Last: This full size waterproof mattress protector is crafted from high quality bamboo material and superior TPU Lamination. This combination ensures that the mattress protector can withstand daily use and maintain its shape, providing long-lasting protection for your full mattress. Its hypoallergenic properties make it ideal for those with sensitive skin or allergies. The noiseless design ensures a peaceful night's rest, free from disruptions. Breathable Material: The breathable design of the mattress protector allows air to circulate freely, promoting temperature regulation and a cool and comfortable sleep environment. Additionally, the mattress cover is 100% waterproof, guarding your full mattress against spills and accidents, while also regulating heat for a comfortable night's rest. Exquisite Present/ Elegant Presentation: With its sleek and stylish design, this waterproof full mattress protector makes a sophisticated and functional addition to any bedding ensemble. The mattress cover makes a thoughtful gift for anyone seeking to elevate their sleeping experience. Care Instructions: This full size mattress protector is easy to care for and maintain. Simply machine wash before use, avoiding the use of bleach or fabric softener, and dry on lowest heat setting. Do not iron or dry clean. To dry quickly, wash and tumble dry with linens. The protector’s durable construction and high-quality material can withstand multiple wash cycles, ensuring long-lasting performance and protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hppI5mtnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfety","source_asin":"B0C2HTT5DR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HTT5DR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HTT5DR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":446978,"name":"Home Styles The French Countryside Media Chest, Oak/Rubbed White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812T3Qt2wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Home Styles French Countryside Collection boasts posh charm. From the proud French leg design to the unique one of a kind rubbed finish, the Home Styles French Countryside Collection is a flawless balance of warmth and elegance. The media chest is constructed of hardwood solids, engineered wood and oak veneers in a distressed oak and heavily rubbed white finish. The distressed oak features several distressing techniques such as worm holes, fly specking and small indentations. Features include four storage drawers (top two drawers are split drawers), top drawers are felt-lined and cable accessibility through hutch for all your media needs. Design features include shaped carved proud legs, raised corner peg accents and detailed brass hardware. Assembly required. Size: 36w 18.5d 38h.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812T3Qt2wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B00GKBENN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-446978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GKBENN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GKBENN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
